<div class="rounded-3 d-flex">
  <div class="d-flex align-items-center me-3">
    <i class="material-icons text-secondary point me-1" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#keidoro_modal">
      info
    </i>
    <strong class="text-primary fs-5 me-1 text-nowrap">
      KEID<span style="display: inline-block; transform: translateY(-2px); margin: 0 -5px;">💰</span>RO</strong>
  </div>

  <form id="keidoro" action="/vocab/keidoro" method="POST" class="menuitem d-flex justify-content-end w-100">
    <input type="hidden" value="" name="deck">
    <input type="hidden" value="" name="deckType">
    <input type="hidden" value="" name="deckName">

    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">Start</button>
  </form>

</div>


<div id="keidoro_modal" class="modal fade">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg">
    <div class="modal-content">

      <div class="modal-header">
        <h3 class="modal-title">Keidoro</h3>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <p>A cooperative card-flipping game based on Keidoro (Cops and Robbers).
          Have students, pairs or groups take turns calling out the items on
          cards. The teacher flips the cards to reveal hidden loot and special
          characters. At some point a robber will appear and steal all the loot.</p>

        <div class="alert alert-info py-2">
          <strong>Objective:</strong>
          Students practice vocabulary while working together as a class to
          Catch the Thief and defuse the Bomb to win!
        </div>

        <h5 class="mt-4 mb-3"><strong>Special Cards & Game Items:</strong></h5>
        <div class="row g-3">
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border bg-light">
              <div class="card-body d-flex align-items-center">
                <img src="/image/keidoro/cop.png" alt="Cop" class="me-3 rounded flex-shrink-0"
                  style="width: 56px; height: 56px; object-fit: contain;">
                <div>
                  <h6 class="card-title fw-bold mb-1">Cop</h6>
                  <p class="card-text small mb-0">Searches for the Thief! Once flipped, you get 5 search attempts.
                    Flipping loot cards consumes search attempts.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border bg-light">
              <div class="card-body d-flex align-items-center">
                <img src="/image/keidoro/thief.png" alt="Thief" class="me-3 rounded flex-shrink-0"
                  style="width: 56px; height: 56px; object-fit: contain;">
                <div>
                  <h6 class="card-title fw-bold mb-1">Thief</h6>
                  <p class="card-text small mb-0">If flipped while the Cop is active, the Cop catches the Thief. If
                    search attempts run out, the Thief escapes with the loot!</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border bg-light">
              <div class="card-body d-flex align-items-center">
                <img src="/image/keidoro/bomb.png" alt="Bomb" class="me-3 rounded flex-shrink-0"
                  style="width: 56px; height: 56px; object-fit: contain;">
                <div>
                  <h6 class="card-title fw-bold mb-1">Bomb</h6>
                  <p class="card-text small mb-0">Starts a 4-flip countdown timer when revealed. If the next card
                    flipped after timer reaches 0 is loot, the bomb explodes!</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border bg-light">
              <div class="card-body d-flex align-items-center">
                <img src="/image/keidoro/bombsquad.png" alt="Bomb Squad" class="me-3 rounded flex-shrink-0"
                  style="width: 56px; height: 56px; object-fit: contain;">
                <div>
                  <h6 class="card-title fw-bold mb-1">Bomb Squad</h6>
                  <p class="card-text small mb-0">Immediately defuses an armed Bomb when flipped.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-12">
            <div class="card shadow-sm border bg-light">
              <div class="card-body d-flex align-items-center">
                <img src="/image/keidoro/treasure.png" alt="Loot" class="me-3 rounded flex-shrink-0"
                  style="width: 56px; height: 56px; object-fit: contain;">
                <div>
                  <h6 class="card-title fw-bold mb-1">Loot Cards</h6>
                  <p class="card-text small mb-0">Cards contain hidden loot such as gold, treasure, and cash. Collect as
                    much as possible without letting the Thief escape or the Bomb explode!</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>